      "title": "Numerics",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "74e5a5b2-054a-4c53-84de-f01ebcceac78",
          "text": "Explain the difference between absolute error and relative error in numerical computations, providing an example where one might be more appropriate than the other."
        },
        {
          "id": "1a8b6448-ce37-46dc-b150-18a9dae689c5",
          "text": "Describe the main challenges associated with representing real numbers as floating-point numbers in a computer, and how these challenges can impact the accuracy of calculations."
        },
        {
          "id": "90eee098-0512-44cb-a9e5-37e864db1182",
          "text": "Outline the basic principle of the Bisection Method for finding roots of a function, and discuss its advantages and disadvantages compared to methods like Newton-Raphson."
